{"id":"6b23223b4dd97161","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy.md","title":"分层真理谓词只为更低层配置真理模式","display":"prop-truth-definition-hierarchy — 分层真理谓词只为更低层配置真理模式","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy","aliases":["91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy","91-prop-definition-hierarchy","91-prop-truth-definition-levels"],"display":"prop-truth-definition-hierarchy — 分层真理谓词只为更低层配置真理模式","depends_on":["[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy</span><span>91-prop-definition-hierarchy</span><span>91-prop-truth-definition-levels</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-definition-hierarchy — 分层真理谓词只为更低层配置真理模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\cup\\{T_\\alpha\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\cup\\{T_\\alpha\\}\\)</span> (后继层语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (对前驱封闭的有效序数指标集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\)</span> (第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 层句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha\">\\(\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\)</span> 句子的去引号模式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha})\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha})\\)</span> (第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 层内部定义其全部标准真理)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_\\alpha)\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\)</span> 的语法可编码且支持对角引理)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definition\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\neg\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\,\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha\\vdash\nT_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definition\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\neg\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\,\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha\\vdash\nT_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项是在每层具备足够语法表达与对角化条件时的 Tarski 不可定义性。\n第二项不是说高层符号仅凭加入语言就“定义”了低层真理；还必须给\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 配置所示去引号或满足公理。</p>\n<p>分层限制只为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\)</span> 句配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 的真理模式，从而\n不会把自己的说谎者纳入同一 T-schema。无类型理论改用固定点、超赋值或规则系统处理\n自指，但这并不推翻每个层级内部的 Tarski 限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathcal L_\\alpha\\cup\\{T_\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha})","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definition\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathcal L_\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\neg\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_\\alpha}\\,\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha\\vdash\nT_\\alpha(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":2033,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["8f93c57db760a2b7","c289f1c721012496"]}